5504:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
5505:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set mode single-ended or differential input of the selected
