5520:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         configuration:
5521:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC1: Channels 0, 6, 7, 8, 9, 13, 14, 15, 17, and 19
